<title>USA: US Diagnostic names Wayne Moor as CFO.</title>
<headline>US Diagnostic names Wayne Moor as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Diagnostic Inc said Thursday it had appointed Wayne Moor as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The move marks the company's latest step to regain its footing after recent turmoil that led to its placing two top executives on administrative leave. Since then, a new management team has been installed.</p>
<p>Moor has held various financial executive positions over the last 22 years and was formerly with Arthur Anderson LLP.</p>
